    {
      "text": "Diagram of equity factors (Figure B9) shown as five grey circles: Access and transport issues, Suitability to low-income country setting, Scalability for large scale screening programmes, Affected by the infrastructure required and Suitability to subgroups.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
